cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TensorLBM in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TensorLBM"
version: "0.3.0"
date-released: "2026-08-02"
abstract: >
  TensorLBM is a PyTorch-based Lattice Boltzmann Method (LBM) platform for
  reproducible CFD research.  It covers D2Q9, D3Q19, and D3Q27 lattices with
  BGK, MRT, TRT, RLBM, and Cumulant collision operators, adaptive mesh
  refinement, DG-LBM hybrid solver, LES/RANS turbulence models, multiphase
  flow, IBM, thermal LBM, and AI turbulence closure (MLP, FNO2d, Transformer).
repository-code: "https://github.com/cxs503/TensorLBM"
url: "https://github.com/cxs503/TensorLBM"
license: GPL-3.0
authors:
  - family-names: "chuxuesen"
    email: "cxs503@163.com"
    alias: "cxs503"
keywords:
  - lattice boltzmann method
  - computational fluid dynamics
  - pytorch
  - machine learning
  - turbulence
  - neural operator
  - LBM
